/target
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk
.env
.DS_Store

# Scratch from builds and background jobs, at the repo root only. Anchored deliberately: a bare
# *.log would also untrack any measurement artefact we later commit under docs/.
/*.err
/*.out
/*.log

# Alternate build trees from CARGO_TARGET_DIR=target-<something>, which is how two agents avoid
# serving each other a stale binary out of one shared target dir.
/target-*/

# Relic data. Never committed - the corpus lives in object storage and is addressed by hash.
/relics/
*.parquet
*.roaring
*.sidecar
